# Git commits

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any Cursor/agent co-author trailer to commit messages.
- Do not attribute commits to Cursor, cursoragent, or AI agents.
- Write commit messages as normal human-authored commits only.
